*.dex
*.class
*.jar
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
output-metadata.json
baselineProfiles/

# There is deliberately no exception re-including an APK. Release binaries are
# attached to a GitHub Release by the Release workflow, never committed: a binary
# in the repository is served through the raw file path, which a phone browser
# refuses or saves under the wrong name, and it bloats every clone for no gain.

